Z||000010||pontiacs4me||07-10-2001||02:04 AM||||The stupid city of wichita raised traffic fines 3x on july first.  to raise 209 million dollars for some stupid crap, probably to buy all the officials new mercedes.  anyway usually at the end of march, then the end of june, then the end of september, then the end of the year, the cops are out thick.  For quota, of course they deny quotas, but its really weird that the cops are out so thick at the end of every 3 months.  Anyway, now that the city is out to raise 209 mill, the cops are out thick all the time, and I just found out from my insurance lady, that they are going to start ticketing for 1-5 over which has never been done before here.  Ive been driving for 6 years, and I never had a ticket until last week.  51 in a 40, in my firebird, just after I dropped off my girl, after we saw the fast and the furious.  The cop wrote the ticket before he even came up to my window to ask for my liscense and insurance.  I couldnt talk my way out of it for nothing.  Theyre out to get everybody for anything.  <BR>I cant wait until a few people get killed.  People are going to start getting multiple tickets, and people are going to start fleeing, and maybe someone downtown will figure out that maybe they need to come up with another way to raise all that money.  Im done ranting, damn I hate this town.||||reg||1
